<title>MEXICO: New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update -USDA.</title>
<headline>New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly update of New Mexico</p>
<p>cattle exports to Mexico, to July 4 - USDA. (Livestock per</p>
<p>head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year).</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     641	    15,281     1,605</p>
<p>    Calves			    0		   1	   0</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    12	     1,715	 458</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    74	     5,203	 743</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287903))</p>
</text>
